  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        79.17810516172915,
        84.57661233184704,
        110.11515083706028,
        93.22286399292014
      ],
      "text": "Test 3\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        78.81820468372129,
        118.76715774259372,
        539.7428171614494,
        147.57287384155825
      ],
      "text": "E\nThe device is aimed at a wide variety ofusers — from homeowners in the developing\nworld who do not have a constant supply ofwater to people living offthe grid in\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        103.29143718825574,
        148.99879789525394,
        542.9566159611602,
        178.88529911294958
      ],
      "text": "rural parts of the US. The first commercial versions of the Desolenator are expected\nto be in operation in India early next year, after field tests are carried out. The market\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.01123814427147,
        179.95023900392988,
        535.8774016759704,
        192.91961649553951
      ],
      "text": "for the self-sufficient devices in developing countries is twofold — those who cannot\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.01123814427147,
        194.34625812424426,
        536.1076700319354,
        223.1516081135103
      ],
      "text": "afford the money for the device outright and pay through microfinance, and middle-\nincome homes that can lease their own equipment. ‘People in India don’t pay for a\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.01123814427147,
        224.93779875491234,
        532.2387984709027,
        254.10376679719528
      ],
      "text": "fridge outright; they pay for it over six months. They would put the Desolenator on\ntheir roof and hook it up to their municipal supply and they would get very reliable\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.37113862227933,
        253.72983699554112,
        521.2079425440446,
        271.02234031768734
      ],
      "text": "drinking water ona daily basis,’ Janssen says. In the developed world, it is armed\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.37113862227933,
        270.2852589839027,
        528.5876596697585,
        299.8093408888648
      ],
      "text": "at niche markets where tap water is unavailable — for camping, on boats, or for the\nmilitary, for instance.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        79.89790611774487,
        308.4347096527358,
        529.1257530602176,
        322.48485761868864
      ],
      "text": "F\nPrices will vary according to where it is bought. In the developing world, the price\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.73103910028719,
        323.19062925105806,
        535.1000775641273,
        352.7164977713489
      ],
      "text": "will depend on what deal aid organisations can negotiate. In developed countries, it\nis likely to come in at $1,000 (£685) a unit, said Janssen. ‘We are a venture with a\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        104.73103910028719,
        353.4222694037183,
        543.8096222698761,
        398.4242392324335
      ],
      "text": "social mission. We are aware that the product we have envisioned is mainly finding\napplication in the developing world and humanitarian sector and that this is the way\nwe will proceed. We do realise, though, that to be a viable company there is a bottom\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        79.89790611774487,
        400.92913250075577,
        540.1564918319721,
        436.2141408885693
      ],
      "text": "line to keep in mind,’ he says.\nG\nThe company itself is based at Imperial College London, although Janssen, its chief\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        105.09093957829505,
        436.91918030154176,
        541.2435740375173,
        481.20096842015477
      ],
      "text": "executive, still lives in the UAE. It has raised £340,000 in funding so far. Within two\nyears, he says, the company aims to be selling 1,000 units a month, mainly in the\nhumanitarian field. They are expected to be sold in areas such as Australia, northern\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        105.45084005630291,
        484.06614292057134,
        279.09210100312333,
        496.31500188115626
      ],
      "text": "Chile, Peru, Texas and California.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        81.69740850778416,
        772.7063262828749,
        93.8764430266722,
        781.3525486551721
      ],
      "text": "64\n"
    }
  ]
